      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَاجٌ</span></b>  <i>A place to which one turns;</i> or <i>in which
one remains, stays, dwells,</i> or <i>abides.</i> (Har p. 325.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also an inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاجَ</span> signifying “ he remained ” &amp;c.: (K:) and of the verb in the phrase
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُجْتُ البَعِيرَ</span>. (S, O.)

